WEBVTT

00:00:25.790 --> 00:00:27.420
<i>Every day, the sky flows on,</i>

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:30.920
<i>as if a "play" button
has been pressed again and again.</i>

00:00:32.010 --> 00:00:33.880
<i>A scene that never changes.</i>

00:00:34.180 --> 00:00:35.180
<i>No dissatisfaction.</i>

00:00:35.890 --> 00:00:38.100
<i>That must be proof of peace.</i>

00:00:38.930 --> 00:00:43.810
<i>I was scouted out and entered show business,
but the world didn't change otherwise for me.</i>

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:49.360
<i>Shooting is starting today for the drama
that will mark my debut as an actor.</i>

00:00:49.770 --> 00:00:52.650
<i>As always,
everything was pretty much going smoothly.</i>

00:00:53.860 --> 00:00:56.780
I'm Taguchi, Junta Azumaya's manager.

00:00:56.780 --> 00:00:59.660
Azumaya, this is the director, Mr. Kadokura.

00:00:59.660 --> 00:01:01.040
I'm Junta Azumaya.

00:01:01.910 --> 00:01:03.120
Nice to meet you.

00:01:03.870 --> 00:01:05.580
N-Nice to meet you!

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:06.580
<i>He's hooked!</i>

00:01:06.580 --> 00:01:08.830
Y-You're really popular right now, huh?

00:01:08.830 --> 00:01:11.380
Your hair and eye color are light.
Maybe you're half-Japanese?

00:01:11.380 --> 00:01:13.210
My grandfather is a Spaniard...

00:01:12.380 --> 00:01:14.550
Mr. Saijo! Good morning!

00:01:14.550 --> 00:01:16.220
Good morning!

00:01:16.220 --> 00:01:17.430
Good morning.

00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:19.090
There's Takato!

00:01:19.090 --> 00:01:20.680
Hi, Saijo!

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:21.970
Long time no see.

00:01:26.140 --> 00:01:27.390
<i>So this person is...</i>

00:01:28.900 --> 00:01:30.940
<i>Takato Saijo.</i>

00:03:04.280 --> 00:03:08.750
hug 7 "Can I keep liking you?"

00:03:05.330 --> 00:03:09.160
It's a pleasure to meet you.
I'm Junta Azumaya from Mitsuya Production.

00:03:09.460 --> 00:03:10.830
I look forward to working with you.

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:19.630
Oh. I'm glad to have the chance
to work with you on your drama debut.

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:21.510
Let's make this a great one.

00:03:21.680 --> 00:03:22.590
Yes!

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:26.510
<i>Was he appraising me?</i>

00:03:27.470 --> 00:03:31.770
<i>"Vial of the Sun" was a pure love story
about a young perfumer with an eye disease</i>

00:03:31.770 --> 00:03:35.520
<i>and a girl who aims to become a glass artisan.</i>

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:40.950
<i>My role was an aspiring potter and old friend
of the heroine who's in love with her.</i>

00:03:41.450 --> 00:03:43.530
Cut! Okay, we got it!

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:45.990
Then next,
the scene between Hinata and Satomi.

00:03:45.990 --> 00:03:46.910
Okay!

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:49.790
Azumaya, is this really your first time?

00:03:49.790 --> 00:03:51.330
That was great!

00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:52.790
Thank you.

00:03:53.420 --> 00:03:55.130
<i>So I guess how I did that was good.</i>

00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:59.420
<i>For now, it looks like
doing the usual would suffice.</i>

00:04:07.510 --> 00:04:08.930
<i>Um...</i>

00:04:09.640 --> 00:04:11.350
<i>what is this?</i>

00:04:12.270 --> 00:04:13.890
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!

00:04:14.140 --> 00:04:15.940
Stop! Stop!

00:04:15.940 --> 00:04:18.320
What's with this girl's performance?

00:04:16.860 --> 00:04:19.820
Ugh, there he is. Sakamaki, the producer!

00:04:19.360 --> 00:04:24.110
I'm sure this is a tough job for a cheesecake
model, but you've still gotta do your best!

00:04:19.820 --> 00:04:22.860
Don't get too close to him, otherwise you'll
feel like you want to punch him.

00:04:24.110 --> 00:04:27.070
<i>Wow, he looks like pink fish floss.</i>

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:29.080
M-Mr. Sakamaki!
Her performance wasn't that bad.

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:31.410
All right, fine, I guess I've got to lecture you

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:33.870
on the creative frame of mind
that's needed for a drama.

00:04:33.870 --> 00:04:36.170
I'll take you out drinking afterwards, okay?

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:38.750
First workplace harassment,
then sexual harassment.

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:43.220
<i>I wonder if rescuing her here
would have an effect on my next job.</i>

00:04:41.090 --> 00:04:42.800
Thank you.

00:04:43.920 --> 00:04:46.180
Are you off tomorrow? You're off, right?

00:04:44.380 --> 00:04:46.180
<i>Oh, what the hell.</i>

00:04:46.680 --> 00:04:48.510
Hey, Azumaya?!

00:04:46.680 --> 00:04:49.050
Yeah. Then what should we do?

00:04:49.050 --> 00:04:50.310
I guess go to Ginza? Get some sushi...

00:04:54.850 --> 00:04:56.020
Excuse me.

00:04:56.310 --> 00:05:00.860
If we're not going to continue here,
can we go on to my next scene?

00:05:01.820 --> 00:05:03.440
We're just wasting time.

00:05:05.070 --> 00:05:07.240
This has such a gentle form.

00:05:07.360 --> 00:05:11.830
It doesn't have the stiffness of glass
and as I'm holding it, it feels warm.

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:15.410
What?

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:16.750
I knew it.

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:18.790
You're the same as this vial.

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:21.170
The scent of the warm sun.

00:05:21.840 --> 00:05:23.510
Did you make this?

00:05:24.510 --> 00:05:27.130
<i>He delivers such an elegant performance.</i>

00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:29.470
<i>It's like every moment is thoughtful.</i>

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:31.970
<i>My eyes want to follow him
all the way to his fingertips.</i>

00:05:32.770 --> 00:05:35.640
<i>I like this pure feeling of tension.</i>

00:05:35.890 --> 00:05:39.560
<i>It feels like he brings an air of dignity
to this whole set.</i>

00:05:39.940 --> 00:05:41.860
Cut! Okay, we got it!

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:44.610
Well, I'll be on my way.

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:46.030
S-See you tomorrow!

00:05:46.740 --> 00:05:48.820
Th-That's my Saijo!

00:05:48.820 --> 00:05:51.660
You're in a whole other league
than those newbies! Good, good!

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:52.490
You.

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:54.200
You're in my way.

00:05:55.410 --> 00:05:57.250
S-Sorry.

00:05:57.710 --> 00:05:58.540
Thank you.

00:06:02.290 --> 00:06:05.760
Saijo was in a bad mood
because you were doing a terrible job!

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:07.510
You better apologize to him later!

00:06:08.380 --> 00:06:10.800
It's almost impressive how small-time he is.

00:06:10.800 --> 00:06:12.930
<i>The pink fish floss logged out?</i>

00:06:13.260 --> 00:06:17.430
Um, I apologize for making Mr. Saijo angry.

00:06:17.430 --> 00:06:23.070
Oh, no, I think Saijo just put on
a good act to divert Mr. Sakamaki.

00:06:23.940 --> 00:06:27.650
By doing that, Mr. Sakamaki
had to start worrying about Saijo's mood

00:06:27.650 --> 00:06:30.160
and wasn't able
to pick a quarrel with any of us.

00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:32.990
To be honest, that was really my job.

00:06:32.990 --> 00:06:33.870
I'm pathetic.

00:06:34.830 --> 00:06:37.410
Takato, you have to be so cool.

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:43.380
<i>So this is what it's like
to be on the set of a drama.</i>

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:47.210
<i>I don't think it's like anything
I've experienced before. Especially...</i>

00:06:47.590 --> 00:06:49.800
I'd like to order catering for the set,

00:06:49.800 --> 00:06:52.090
and please add an assortment of sweets
that girls would like.

00:06:53.550 --> 00:06:56.890
Yeah, I just want to improve
morale on the set a bit.

00:06:57.220 --> 00:06:59.730
<i>Mr. Saijo didn't go home?</i>

00:07:00.020 --> 00:07:03.610
I'm fine. How many years
do you think I've been doing this?

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:09.110
<i>Strong people like him are just
picture-perfect just by doing that.</i>

00:07:05.190 --> 00:07:07.530
Yeah, sorry for the hassle, Mr. Sasaki.

00:07:07.530 --> 00:07:09.860
Please put the order in. Thanks.

00:07:12.360 --> 00:07:17.370
The next time that producer
rears his head and shows up on set,

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:21.540
I'll embarrass him so badly
that he'll never wear pink again.

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:26.840
"Creative frame of mind," whatever!

00:07:26.840 --> 00:07:29.590
You oughta recreate yourself
from before you were born!

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:33.300
<i>I see. This is what he's like.</i>

00:07:34.800 --> 00:07:36.760
<i>His face that's not on set...</i>

00:07:36.760 --> 00:07:40.810
<i>I mean, it's really different,
but oh man, it's hilarious!</i>

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:40.810
I need more sugar! Come on,
serotonin! Give me some more!

00:07:41.770 --> 00:07:46.940
Well, enough of that little fish,
but this Junta Azumaya...

00:07:48.360 --> 00:07:51.530
It's been a while since I've had to contend
with a major annoyance.

00:07:52.860 --> 00:07:53.990
<i>I see.</i>

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:58.580
<i>He's always been looking at me with hostility.</i>

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:02.410
<i>I guess this is what it feels like to be hated.</i>

00:08:04.630 --> 00:08:05.710
Mr. Saijo.

00:08:06.210 --> 00:08:07.590
Good work today.

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:09.050
A-Azumaya?!

00:08:09.050 --> 00:08:10.420
You like hot chocolate?

00:08:13.590 --> 00:08:15.640
How long have you been here, Azumaya?

00:08:15.640 --> 00:08:16.470
Not long.

00:08:16.470 --> 00:08:17.640
Oh, I see.

00:08:17.640 --> 00:08:19.470
By "not long,"
you mean like four or five minutes?

00:08:19.470 --> 00:08:21.480
No, about 30 seconds.

00:08:21.480 --> 00:08:22.480
Oh, really?

00:08:23.980 --> 00:08:26.940
Mr. Saijo, thank you for earlier.

00:08:28.070 --> 00:08:30.480
Oh, you knew what I was doing, huh?

00:08:30.480 --> 00:08:32.860
Mr. Kadokura explained it.

00:08:32.860 --> 00:08:33.700
Oh.

00:08:34.030 --> 00:08:35.280
I owe him one.

00:08:36.700 --> 00:08:41.450
<i>His eyelashes are so long
that they cast a shadow.</i>

00:08:37.160 --> 00:08:39.660
Then I don't have to spell it out.

00:08:41.450 --> 00:08:45.710
Well, if things have quieted down over there,
I'll return to the studio.

00:08:45.710 --> 00:08:47.670
I have to thank Mr. Kadokura.

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:49.460
Um, Mr. Saijo...

00:08:50.210 --> 00:08:55.510
I really am grateful
to have this chance to work with you.

00:08:55.510 --> 00:08:57.600
I look forward to working with you
until this wraps.

00:08:59.050 --> 00:09:00.350
You're grateful?

00:09:01.060 --> 00:09:03.480
Then I'd better work hard, too.

00:09:03.810 --> 00:09:07.730
So you'll continue to feel that way
to the very end.

00:09:13.110 --> 00:09:15.950
Let's work well together, Azumaya.

00:09:19.370 --> 00:09:20.240
<i>Huh?</i>

00:09:20.580 --> 00:09:23.120
<i>What is this?</i>

00:09:24.120 --> 00:09:25.040
<i>My chest.</i>

00:09:28.420 --> 00:09:33.090
<i>For the first time,
I heard the sound of a noisy sky.</i>

00:09:43.770 --> 00:09:49.860
<i>He slowly opens his eyes as if exhaling,
and then I know he'll look at me.</i>

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:56.820
<i>His expressions, and the way he moves his gaze.
It satisfies all the viewers with his performance.</i>

00:09:56.820 --> 00:09:58.450
<i>He gives us what we want.</i>

00:09:59.160 --> 00:10:00.240
<i>What we want?</i>

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:02.950
<i>What do I want?</i>

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:05.120
<i>Where does that come from?</i>

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:08.460
<i>This stirring in the pit of my stomach...</i>

00:10:09.710 --> 00:10:12.130
<i>What the hell is it?</i>

00:10:13.590 --> 00:10:16.340
I like him. That's why I'm with him.

00:10:16.340 --> 00:10:20.140
Eventually he won't be able
to see you or your work anymore.

00:10:20.470 --> 00:10:21.800
Even if he can't see...

00:10:21.800 --> 00:10:25.020
Even if he can't see, he'll know by touch.

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:26.520
He'll sense me through scent.

00:10:27.310 --> 00:10:29.190
Hinata, choose me.

00:10:29.400 --> 00:10:31.810
Kosuke, let's stop talking about this.

00:10:31.810 --> 00:10:36.690
Be mine. I'll always look at you,
just as I have all this time.

00:10:36.690 --> 00:10:38.320
Wait, Kosuke!

00:10:38.490 --> 00:10:41.870
Cut! Azumaya, Natsume, good work!

00:10:42.240 --> 00:10:43.280
Good work!

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:44.620
Good work.

00:10:54.920 --> 00:10:55.710
Pardon me.

00:10:59.340 --> 00:11:01.090
Good work today.

00:11:01.180 --> 00:11:02.470
Yeah, good work.

00:11:02.970 --> 00:11:07.930
<i>What should I do? It's just the two of us,
but it'll be awkward if I sit far away from him.</i>

00:11:08.390 --> 00:11:09.770
Can I sit next to you?

00:11:11.850 --> 00:11:12.690
Go ahead.

00:11:12.900 --> 00:11:15.770
<i>He totally doesn't want me there.</i>

00:11:20.820 --> 00:11:24.700
<i>This is awkward,
but maybe I'll ask him about before.</i>

00:11:24.700 --> 00:11:27.700
<i>If there's something I've done
to offend him, I'll apologize.</i>

00:11:27.910 --> 00:11:29.750
Um, Mr. Saijo, I—

00:11:29.750 --> 00:11:30.620
I like him.

00:11:33.080 --> 00:11:35.380
I like him. That's why I'm with him.

00:11:35.590 --> 00:11:37.510
- Um, Mr. Saijo?
- Next line.

00:11:38.420 --> 00:11:39.840
<i>From that last scene.</i>

00:11:40.380 --> 00:11:45.350
Eventually he won't be able
to see you or your work anymore.

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:47.010
Even if he can't see...

00:11:47.010 --> 00:11:50.100
Even if he can't see, he'll know by touch.

00:11:50.350 --> 00:11:52.230
- He'll sense me through—
- Choose me.

00:11:52.230 --> 00:11:54.020
Kosuke, let's stop talking about—

00:11:54.020 --> 00:11:56.400
Be mine. I'll...

00:11:56.820 --> 00:11:58.610
<i>Hold her gently in my arms...</i>

00:11:58.610 --> 00:12:01.450
<i>No, hold her as if I'm stealing her away.</i>

00:12:01.900 --> 00:12:06.330
I'll always look at you,
just as I have all this time.

00:12:07.030 --> 00:12:08.790
<i>I'll follow my feelings.</i>

00:12:08.790 --> 00:12:10.120
Azumaya.

00:12:10.450 --> 00:12:12.830
That was much better.

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:15.130
Much better than just saying the lines.

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:19.920
Instead of thinking it out logically,
you're more suited to act from your emotions.

00:12:20.170 --> 00:12:22.800
Maybe you should learn more about yourself.

00:12:22.800 --> 00:12:24.890
About myself?

00:12:25.550 --> 00:12:27.890
I swear, you're sitting on a gold mine.

00:12:27.890 --> 00:12:31.810
Um, Mr. Saijo. I wonder what it is that I want.

00:12:32.230 --> 00:12:33.690
Nothing!

00:12:33.690 --> 00:12:35.060
Thank you.

00:12:36.810 --> 00:12:39.070
Well, I'm going to take a nap
until we get to the location.

00:12:39.070 --> 00:12:41.030
Right! Good night.

00:12:44.740 --> 00:12:48.830
<i>The me I didn't know about
is slowly being dragged out.</i>

00:12:50.490 --> 00:12:53.120
<i>What is it about him?</i>

00:12:56.420 --> 00:12:57.920
And action!

00:12:58.880 --> 00:13:01.130
Are you okay walking around at night?

00:13:03.050 --> 00:13:04.130
You're...

00:13:04.130 --> 00:13:06.390
Don't you remember me?

00:13:06.720 --> 00:13:11.310
Or maybe you can't see faces now
from this distance?

00:13:11.890 --> 00:13:15.060
You're Kosuke, right? I recognize your voice.

00:13:15.060 --> 00:13:16.900
You don't get it, do you?

00:13:17.150 --> 00:13:18.110
But I do.

00:13:18.270 --> 00:13:20.770
I know that you treasure her.

00:13:21.110 --> 00:13:22.900
I know what you want to tell me.

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:24.650
I understand perfectly.

00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:26.950
Mr. Amamiya.

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:30.240
<i>The lines, the emotions,
are coming out of me naturally.</i>

00:13:30.830 --> 00:13:34.870
<i>I want to throw everything I have at him.
More, more.</i>

00:13:35.410 --> 00:13:37.460
Mr. Amamiya, regarding her, how do you—

00:13:45.670 --> 00:13:47.220
I told you to inspect that!

00:13:47.220 --> 00:13:49.680
- I-I'm sorry! Towels! Towels!
- Are you okay, Mr. Saijo?

00:13:54.600 --> 00:13:55.850
<i>I heard a sound.</i>

00:13:58.650 --> 00:13:59.690
Azumaya.

00:13:59.690 --> 00:14:03.400
<i>In my mind, the sky is roiling.</i>

00:14:00.520 --> 00:14:03.400
Why did you...

00:14:05.570 --> 00:14:07.910
<i>Why are you cowering like that?</i>

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:11.120
<i>Why do you look at me like that?</i>

00:14:09.570 --> 00:14:11.450
What?

00:14:13.540 --> 00:14:16.120
<i>Is it because you hate me?</i>

00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:16.120
Azu... maya...

00:14:21.960 --> 00:14:23.590
Saijo! Azumaya!

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:24.920
Are you okay?

00:14:25.210 --> 00:14:26.050
Yes.

00:14:27.130 --> 00:14:30.590
I'm not that wet,
so please take care of Azumaya.

00:14:30.590 --> 00:14:31.470
O-Okay!

00:14:32.100 --> 00:14:34.310
Sorry. But thanks.

00:14:34.890 --> 00:14:35.770
Not at all.

00:14:36.890 --> 00:14:39.310
<i>What was I doing?</i>

00:14:41.310 --> 00:14:42.230
<i>Okay.</i>

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:45.030
<i>I would give everything to you.</i>

00:14:46.820 --> 00:14:50.240
<i>If we hadn't been interrupted,
I would've kissed him.</i>

00:14:51.410 --> 00:14:52.450
<i>Kiss?</i>

00:14:52.450 --> 00:14:55.910
<i>No. It wouldn't have been
anything that gentle.</i>

00:14:56.120 --> 00:14:57.910
<i>I've never felt that before.</i>

00:14:58.330 --> 00:15:00.670
<i>It was as if I'd become a beast.</i>

00:15:02.420 --> 00:15:05.460
<i>For just a moment, he looked scared.</i>

00:15:06.420 --> 00:15:08.380
Maybe he hates me again?

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:17.140
<i>This must be what he saw.</i>

00:15:17.680 --> 00:15:20.140
<i>The face of a man overcome with desire.</i>

00:15:22.100 --> 00:15:23.150
I'm in love with you.

00:15:23.150 --> 00:15:24.480
W-Wait, Kosuke.

00:15:24.480 --> 00:15:25.650
I can't wait.

00:15:25.650 --> 00:15:27.030
I've waited long enough.

00:15:29.860 --> 00:15:30.780
Hinata.

00:15:31.410 --> 00:15:32.780
That was great!

00:15:32.780 --> 00:15:35.280
That was the best of all your scenes together.

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:38.200
Azumaya, what the heck?
A sudden awakening!

00:15:38.580 --> 00:15:39.660
Awakening?

00:15:39.660 --> 00:15:41.920
You seem different ever since that last location.

00:15:41.920 --> 00:15:43.710
Did something cause it?

00:15:49.420 --> 00:15:51.550
Yes, there was something.

00:15:58.680 --> 00:15:59.520
<i>Huh?</i>

00:16:01.100 --> 00:16:03.770
Mr. Saijo, are you not feeling well?

00:16:04.860 --> 00:16:06.900
You're looking a little pale.

00:16:07.860 --> 00:16:09.530
No, I'm fine.

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:12.990
I'm glad you have enough confidence
to worry about my well-being.

00:16:13.660 --> 00:16:15.660
But be sure you stay focused.

00:16:16.660 --> 00:16:17.740
Right.

00:16:18.740 --> 00:16:21.410
But, um, I think you have a slight fever.

00:16:30.010 --> 00:16:31.050
Sorry.

00:16:31.050 --> 00:16:33.930
No, it's my fault. I apologize.

00:16:38.220 --> 00:16:40.470
<i>It hurts. It hurts, but...</i>

00:16:41.180 --> 00:16:45.940
<i>that one moment of contact, even with
that moment of pain, it follows through.</i>

00:16:48.860 --> 00:16:51.240
Excuse me. I'm getting on.

00:16:58.580 --> 00:16:59.660
About before...

00:16:59.910 --> 00:17:02.660
- Yes?
- Did I hurt your hand?

00:17:03.330 --> 00:17:05.580
No, it was nothing.

00:17:05.580 --> 00:17:07.460
Oh. Good.

00:17:08.340 --> 00:17:12.760
One actor hurting another
is no laughing matter.

00:17:14.130 --> 00:17:16.300
<i>I want to hug his shoulders to hold him up.</i>

00:17:16.590 --> 00:17:17.550
<i>But...</i>

00:17:18.550 --> 00:17:22.930
<i>But I'm sure he just wants to hurry and get away
from me, and out of this enclosed space.</i>

00:17:26.150 --> 00:17:28.060
<i>Is he really okay?</i>

00:17:28.770 --> 00:17:31.570
<i>He seems to be walking normally, but...</i>

00:17:32.570 --> 00:17:36.070
<i>Worrying about him too much
will only put him in a fouler mood.</i>

00:17:39.280 --> 00:17:40.330
Mr. Saijo!

00:17:42.120 --> 00:17:43.330
Pardon me.

00:17:44.540 --> 00:17:47.540
You're a lot warmer than I thought.
The hospital...

00:17:48.790 --> 00:17:50.590
Crap. I only have my motorcycle.

00:17:51.710 --> 00:17:53.590
Excuse me. I need a taxi.

00:17:53.590 --> 00:17:56.130
The location is the studio in Aoumi.
Yes, that's right.

00:17:57.300 --> 00:17:59.680
Yes. Thank you.

00:18:01.640 --> 00:18:05.680
I know you don't want to be touched by me,
but please endure it for now.

00:18:12.440 --> 00:18:17.400
<i>So the desire to treasure someone is connected
to the desire of wanting someone all to yourself.</i>

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:19.620
<i>Mr. Saijo.</i>

00:18:20.570 --> 00:18:22.950
<i>I've fallen in love with you.</i>

00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:26.460
<i>I'm sorry. Even if you hate me...</i>

00:18:27.960 --> 00:18:30.630
Can I keep liking you?

00:18:35.800 --> 00:18:39.130
Oh, there it is.
Sasaki here. I'm coming in!

00:18:39.800 --> 00:18:40.640
Good evening!

00:18:40.930 --> 00:18:42.050
Good evening.

00:18:42.050 --> 00:18:43.890
I apologize that you went to all this trouble.

00:18:43.890 --> 00:18:45.560
No, no trouble at all.

00:18:45.560 --> 00:18:48.600
The doctor said that with
the IV and plenty of sleep, he should be fine.

00:18:48.600 --> 00:18:53.110
I wondered what it was about
when you called my agency.

00:18:53.110 --> 00:18:55.780
It must've been tough getting him here,
carrying a tall man like him.

00:18:56.240 --> 00:18:58.200
No, he was light.

00:18:58.610 --> 00:19:01.820
I was a little surprised by how slender he is.

00:19:01.950 --> 00:19:04.330
Oh, don't tell him that, okay?

00:19:04.330 --> 00:19:07.160
He has a complex about how hard it is
for him to put on muscle.

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:12.880
You can go, Azumaya.

00:19:13.250 --> 00:19:14.550
Thank you for tonight.

00:19:14.550 --> 00:19:17.720
When Takato wakes up,
I'll tell him everything you did.

00:19:18.590 --> 00:19:21.970
If possible, please don't tell him
I carried him here.

00:19:23.050 --> 00:19:24.970
Are you self-conscious about it?

00:19:24.970 --> 00:19:25.810
Yes.

00:19:26.270 --> 00:19:30.020
It seems that I've done nothing
but annoy Mr. Saijo this shoot.

00:19:30.020 --> 00:19:34.610
Don't let him get to you.
He's the one who gets cranky all the time.

00:19:34.730 --> 00:19:35.610
Oh, come on.

00:19:36.190 --> 00:19:39.610
It's unusual for him to so openly
treat someone like an enemy.

00:19:40.360 --> 00:19:43.200
Maybe that means
he has great expectations for you.

00:19:58.550 --> 00:20:02.930
<i>This pain, heartache, sweetness, and rush...</i>

00:20:04.140 --> 00:20:06.510
<i>I probably can't make them vanish.</i>

00:20:09.270 --> 00:20:10.770
<i>A motorcycle is no good.</i>

00:20:10.770 --> 00:20:12.190
<i>I need to get a car.</i>

00:20:12.690 --> 00:20:16.980
<i>So I can give a ride to the person dear to me
whenever they might need one.</i>

00:20:18.190 --> 00:20:21.860
<i>This shoot is almost over.</i>

00:20:24.570 --> 00:20:27.700
Okay, please stay like this
until they call for you.

00:20:27.700 --> 00:20:29.120
Roger that.

00:20:32.460 --> 00:20:35.250
<i>This is the last day.</i>

00:20:40.920 --> 00:20:43.930
<i>No. I won't let it be the last day.</i>

00:20:45.390 --> 00:20:49.680
<i>Since meeting you, I've learned
what it is to truly "want" something.</i>

00:20:50.600 --> 00:20:53.190
<i>I'm going to chase you, Takato.</i>

00:20:59.530 --> 00:21:02.740
<i>So that the next time we meet,
we'll be side by side</i>

00:21:02.740 --> 00:21:07.240
<i>and I'll be able to express these feelings
and take you in my arms.</i>

00:21:07.910 --> 00:21:12.410
<i>I'll firm my resolve, and start preparing myself
so I can obtain what's precious to me.</i>

00:21:18.340 --> 00:21:21.420
First off, could we have a few words
from our lead actor, Azumaya?

00:21:21.420 --> 00:21:22.840
S-Sure.

00:21:23.920 --> 00:21:27.180
I'm Junta Azumaya,
and I'll be playing the main character.

00:21:25.010 --> 00:21:27.180
<i>Even now, I feel like
I'm going to pounce on you.</i>

00:21:29.050 --> 00:21:31.100
<i>I'm sorry, Takato.</i>

00:21:31.100 --> 00:21:33.850
I'll do my very best
and I look forward to working with you!

00:21:32.180 --> 00:21:33.850
<i>But I swear...</i>

00:21:34.520 --> 00:21:36.350
<i>I'm going to make you mine.</i>

00:21:37.610 --> 00:21:40.320
So we start shooting next week.

00:21:40.320 --> 00:21:42.480
I look forward to working with all of you.

00:21:42.480 --> 00:21:44.110
I look forward to working with you!

00:21:48.660 --> 00:21:50.490
<i>All right, let's go.</i>

00:21:53.200 --> 00:21:54.330
Mr. Saijo!

00:23:25.840 --> 00:23:29.010
Ever since the day I said "I like you,"

00:23:29.010 --> 00:23:34.760
I've been more self-conscious than ever
when we do couple-like things.

00:23:34.760 --> 00:23:36.310
It's kind of a problem.

00:23:36.430 --> 00:23:39.980
hug8
"H-Hands off my swim trunks."
